description\":\"all is valid\",\"data\":{\"all\":1},\"valid\":true},{\"description\":\"all + foo is valid\",\"data\":{\"all\":1,\"foo\":1},\"valid\":true},{\"description\":\"all + a is invalid\",\"data\":{\"all\":1,\"a\":1},\"valid\":false}]") == ""

